# Copy to .env and adjust. Every CLI loads .env via python-dotenv at startup.

# Local directory of real genomes used by opt-in tests and dogfooding.
# Tests skip when it is unset or missing. Never copy anything from it into assets/.
JUST_VCF_SAMPLES_DIR=/data/genomes

# Where the loader keeps rewritten copies of inputs polars-bio cannot read as they are (archived VCFs,
# headers needing repair) and the per-facet parquet spills a VCF load writes. Defaults to the
# platform's user cache directory. just_vcf.clear_cache removes entries by source or by age (RM268).
# JUST_VCF_CACHE_DIR=

# The gtars refget store resolve_ref reads REF from (RM3). A FASTA passed to resolve_ref or to
# ReferenceStore.add_fasta is added here once and read from the store after that. Defaults to
# reference/ under the cache directory above. A GRCh38 primary assembly takes about 1.1 GB.
# JUST_VCF_REFERENCE_DIR=

# Directory of ancestry reference panels (docs/ANCESTRY_PANELS.md): Privé's reference as
# `just_vcf.ancestry.build_prive_reference` writes it, and reference-PCA panels in just-prs's layout.
# Only the opt-in panel tests read it; they skip when it is unset or missing.
# JUST_VCF_ANCESTRY_DIR=

# A real reference store (gtars refget, GRCh37 and GRCh38) for the opt-in tests that read an assembly,
# such as normalize against bcftools on a PGP-HMS upload. Only read. They skip when it is unset or missing.
# JUST_VCF_TEST_REFERENCE_DIR=

# Illumina manifest zips (GSA-24v3-0 A1, OmniExpress-24 v1.2 A1; docs/PROVENANCE.md) for the opt-in test
# that re-derives the chip marker sample shipped in the package (just_vcf/chip_markers.json). Only read;
# the test skips when it is unset or missing. The library itself never reads the manifests.
# JUST_VCF_MANIFESTS_DIR=
